      <elementName>Text</elementName>
      <elementAttributes>
        <entry>
          <string>Description</string>
          <string>dev 508f47c TRAP logic (cpu-32 test.dig), kept for reference after the forward-test rework.
Fl_TRAP / Fl_TRAP-_INST / Fl_TRAP-_EP fed flush-mux T_v / T_id / T_ep (see flush-mux-old.dig),
so a decoded trap (halt included) flushed the younger instructions.</string>
        </entry>
      </elementAttributes>
